# CardProperty.java:1929-1949: "wasCastFromYourHandByYou" holds for a card
# its controller cast from their own hand, and the cast record stays on the
# permanent the spell becomes. Coal Stoker's ETB trigger ("if you cast it from
# your hand, add {R}{R}{R}", ValidCard$ Card.wasCastFromYourHandByYou+Self)
# fires: four Mountains pay for it, and of the {R}{R}{R} it adds one pays for
# the Lightning Bolt that follows with no land left untapped; {R}{R} floats.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
tapformana human 4 R
tapformana human 5 R
tapformana human 6 R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
queue paygeneric R
castspell human 1
resolvestack
queue targets ai
castspell human 2
resolvestack
